														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4848309">
									

<p>This is actually a fun idea, as weird as I know that sounds. While there are a number of Kid-TV SCP's, this is just different enough from them that it could work.</p>
<p>1) You need to flesh it out a bit. There's just nothing really here; it's just a skeleton. To whom or what the sacrifice is to needs to be better defined. There is also an issue in how so many kids are killed on a regular basis without anyone finding out; even if you used nothing but runaways and orphans the murder toll would create curiosity at some point.</p>
<p>2) The UIU doesn't hand cases off to The Foundation without a good reason. Why did they do that this time?</p>
<p>It's an excellent start, it just needs some fleshing out.</p>

