<p>1) You need to seriously work on the grammar issues. They make it really difficult to read the idea.</p>
<p>2) This is actually a fun idea; while there aren't a lot of thaumaturgical articles, there are a number of shamans and wizards mentioned. You don't need to stress too much on why it's anomalous; if the spells work as corrected then the item itself is effectively anomalous.</p>
<p>3) It may not be a bad idea to work on the person offering the classes; he will definitely be a POI if he isn't already. Also, where he got the book is of interest; the professor could have been scammed himself or is just anomalous himself to make some of the spells work.</p>
<p>Otherwise, this is a really neat idea; I hope it works!</p>

